Package: com.moxuan1121.fontchange
Name: Font Package Installer
Version: 2.0.0-alpha17
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Imports ZIP font packages, refreshes the bindfs or mnt font copy, applies fonts, switches language natively, and reboots userspace.
